This directory is served from the site root as-is.

Add these files by hand:
  cv.pdf  — the CV behind the "Open CV" button (path: profile.cvUrl)
  og.png  — social preview, 1200x630 (path: profile.seo.ogImage)

robots.txt and sitemap.xml are deliberately absent here: they are generated
by the @nuxtjs/robots and @nuxtjs/sitemap modules. A static file would
shadow the generated one and drift from NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL.
